WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.537
The appointment is at fourteen hundred hours.

00:00:02.787 --> 00:00:06.243
Sorry, could you repeat that, please?

00:00:06.493 --> 00:00:10.370
At fourteen hundred hours. At two in the afternoon.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.053
Could you speak more slowly, please?

00:00:13.303 --> 00:00:16.564
Of course. Tuesday at two.

00:00:16.814 --> 00:00:20.573
All right. Tuesday at two. Thank you.
